Third-party software
--------------------

Release archives of this project (not the source repository) include the following unmodified
libraries, each licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 and Copyright The OpenTelemetry Authors.
Neither upstream project has a NOTICE file of its own.

  In lib/:
    opentelemetry-api, opentelemetry-context, opentelemetry-common
    https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java

    opentelemetry-instrumentation-api
    https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation

  In lib/sdk/ (the optional SDK fallback):
    opentelemetry-sdk, opentelemetry-sdk-common, opentelemetry-sdk-trace, opentelemetry-sdk-metrics,
    opentelemetry-sdk-logs, opentelemetry-sdk-extension-autoconfigure,
    opentelemetry-sdk-extension-autoconfigure-spi, opentelemetry-exporter-common,
    opentelemetry-exporter-otlp, opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-common
    https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java

